        "client_msg_id": "988fa639-ce7c-4c0b-9e0f-4506101b773c",
        "text": "The way I'm imagining it it's just a little markup language of drawing commands. <https://git.sr.ht/~akkartik/luaML.love> but with some support for a \"link target\" that the view switches to when you click on a rectangular area.\n\nBasically making image maps in html is quite tedious. This is image maps but well-integrated with a vector- rather than pixel-drawing system.",
